      "message": "fix(wire): keep strict cover checks without arc provenance\n\nRemove the coordinate-only round allowance. Refuse the small drawn polygon with a regression test. Defer coarse-fillet acceptance until the profile carries reliable provenance.\n\nRefs #3208",
